he simultaneous revolts of Zhou Chao in Lingling and Guo Shi in Guiyang, created a coordinated wave of unrest across three commanderies in southern Jing Province. However, the newly appointed Governor of Changsha, Sun Jian, swiftly crushed the rebellion, and his fate remains unknown.","jp":"後漢末期の反乱指導者。中平四年に長沙で挙兵して将軍を自称し、一万余りの軍勢を率いて反乱を起こした。この反乱は零陵の周朝や桂陽の郭石の蜂起と呼応し、荊南三郡が連動する情勢となったが、新任の長沙太守である孫堅に迅速に撃破され、その後の生死は不明である。","kr":"후한 말 민란의 수령. 중평 4년 장사에서 거병하여 스스로 장군이라 칭하고 1만여 무리를 이끌어 반란을 일으켰다. 이는 영릉의 주조, 계양의 곽석의 봉기와 호응하여 형남 3군이 연계되는 국면을 형성했으나, 새로 부임한 장사태수 손견에게 신속히 격파당하였으며 이후 생사는 알 수 없다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10568","remark":"","surname":"区","surnameTc":"區","surnameEn":"Ou","surnameJp":"区","surnameKr":"구","surnameOther":"","name":"星","nameTc":"星","nameEn":"Xing","nameJp":"星","nameKr":"성","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"区星","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"3","workYear":"184","city":"CS1037","gender":"0","rule":"63","force":"70","wise":"38","politics":"33","charm":"62","will":"52","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"3","politicsTalent":"2","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"3","weaponMaster":"21/21/21/66/21/9/50/21","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1004605","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"3900","battleSoulPoint":"6000","debateSoulPoint":"1400","strategy":"","strategy2":"1001205;1000115","professions":"3/0/0/0/3/0/1/0/0/0/3/1/0/0/2/0/0/1/0/0/0/1/0/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"8","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","evaluate":"-4000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"157","show":"184","death":"187","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0